@startuml
[*] as InitialState
Idle as Idle
SelectingAmount as SelectingAmount
InputtingCustomAmount as InputtingCustomAmount
Cancelled as Cancelled
Completed as Completed

InitialState ->> Idle : User initiates transaction
Idle ->> SelectingAmount : User selects predefined amount
SelectingAmount ->> InputtingCustomAmount : User inputs custom withdrawal amount
InputtingCustomAmount ->> Cancelled : User chooses to cancel the transaction
InputtingCustomAmount ->> Completed : Successful withdrawal or other completion condition

Completed ->> [*] : Transaction completed
Cancelled ->> Idle : System returns card after cancellation

[*] as InitialState
@enduml
